WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.150
Takuya-<i>kun</i>... This is very hard to say...

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.480
But even if the ritual succeeds,

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.650
the priestess, Yu-No,
will most likely be annihilated.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.820
That's all I have to say!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.040
Was it interesting, guys?

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.370
The ritual that we thought was a lie...

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.580
And the priestess...
and what the Divine Emperor is doing...

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.800
It was all true...

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:35.340
We came here to stop the ritual. But...

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.300
If that happens,
I think you'll all have a problem.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.970
Leader...

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:25.040
"Episode 25: The Promised Ritual"

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.870
Ryuzoji...

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.620
I won't let you get away!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.000
I'm sorry.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.050
It's too chaotic to say for sure,

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:39.800
but the priestess will be sent
beyond the dimensional horizon,

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:43.720
and there's a chance she'll be
able to survive in another world.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:46.310
The chance is one in
about ten billion, though...

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.890
But...

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:51.980
Takuya-<i>kun</i>, if the ritual isn't held,

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:55.360
both worlds will be destroyed.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:59.860
Everything depends on 
the priestess. On Yu-No!

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:03.700
What am I supposed to tell her?

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:07.040
I'll take you to her room later.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.380
We will now begin
the execution of the resistance.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.250
Aim!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.550
--Stop.
--Fire!

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.100
Divine Emperor!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.180
Why are you stopping the execution?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:31.190
They infiltrated the hall of memories!

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.980
And that is why they must survive.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:40.900
You learned the truth 
in the hall of memories.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:49.450
Please. Help us.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.210
The Divine Emperor isn't evil?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.500
It was all a misunderstanding?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.260
It's too late for that now!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.130
Leader!

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.550
I'm sorry.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.140
I was wrong.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:12.020
The Divine Emperor says
she needs our power to save this world.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:16.770
So I want to help her
for the sake of the imperial city.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.110
I know it's selfish.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:23.820
But if you'll still follow 
me, I want your help.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.700
W-Well, it's a shock, sure,

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.700
suddenly finding out the truth.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:32.960
Listen, guys, we don't have time--

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.790
We know that.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:38.670
The resistance's job is 
to protect the people.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:42.300
Well, saving the world might be fun.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.630
If we don't have a choice,
then we'll just do it.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.590
We'll follow you, Leader.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.720
Let's all make the ritual a success!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:53.390
So that's the deal, Amanda.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.770
Guys...

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.690
Thank you!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.530
Daddy?

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.330
Yu-No...

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.910
Daddy!

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.540
I missed you!

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:19.460
Jeez... You're just like when you were a kid.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.470
What did you want to talk about?

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.930
What's wrong?

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.930
Well...

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.640
It's about the ritual...

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.020
Um...

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:38.730
The priestess has an important job, I guess,

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:45.610
so, um... it's something only you can do...

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:49.280
But then you'll...

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.740
So, um...

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:56.080
I might disappear, right?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.330
You knew?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.250
Yeah.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:02.420
But if I don't do anything,
you and everyone else will die, right?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:06.220
Well... Yeah, that's what they said.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:09.590
This is something I have to do.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:13.220
It's why I was born.

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.680
Yu-No...

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:22.610
I'm sorry... You're the one
who must be most scared,

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:25.780
so I should be putting 
on a brave face, too...

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.660
I'm not scared!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.990
Even if something happens,
you'll come save me, right?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.160
Of course.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.250
Oh, right.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.460
Take this...

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.670
It's so pretty...

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.250
It's a good-luck charm...

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:49.430
So that if something happens
to you, I can come to you.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.890
Daddy, I love you.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.430
Me too, Yu-No.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.270
You even asked the resistance for help...

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:05.770
Why such strict security?

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.530
To fight Ryuzoji.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.200
Normal weapons are of no use.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.530
But he just escaped from prison.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:17.410
I can't see him coming back.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:22.000
No. He'll come back.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.710
I know it.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.710
Stop!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.430
I won't let you get away!

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.610
You can't sleep?

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:48.730
Yeah, basically.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:52.320
The view here's pretty nice.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:57.370
It's hard to believe that
this world is about to end, isn't it?

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:00.200
Only if we don't do something, right?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.080
Yeah. I won't let it end.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.790
The resistance will help the Divine Emperor

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.300
and do everything we can for the ritual.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.340
You're just like Ailia.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:16.640
When this is all over,
maybe I'll go visit her grave.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.930
Yeah, I'm sure she'd like that.

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:24.940
It didn't end up being my last night.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:29.190
There will be no more last nights.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:42.910
You're very attached to your job,
Dimensional Inspector.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:47.580
I'll follow you anywhere 
in order to arrest you.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.880
Even crossing over dimensions?

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:54.340
Answer me. Why did you
annihilate three event trees?

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.260
Why did you stop the splitting?

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.850
An A-Class dimensional criminal like me

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:03.140
is no stranger to dedicated agents like you.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:06.850
Don't tell me... You wiped out
the entire trees because of that?

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.150
Letting all those innocent people die?

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:14.030
All life is self-serving, 
and I am no exception.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:18.990
What's different between what I do
and the way you breed cattle to live?

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:22.450
Pure, perfect evil...

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:25.210
I can't let you run free another instant!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:32.050
Oops. It's dangerous to
show you too much of my body.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:35.090
Show me your real body. I'll end this.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.930
I can't die yet.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:44.520
What you and Abel were researching...
the root of all events...

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.440
I'm interested in it too.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.560
What?

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.820
What are you doing?

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.950
Now then...

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.470
It's finally time...

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.430
Now it will all be over!

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.050
Our long suffering will finally be rewarded!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.730
I'm getting nervous!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.690
Yeah? I'm the same as ever.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.070
That's amazing...

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.280
You're actually scared to death.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:36.780
What?

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:39.490
Proof! Do you have proof?

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.870
I can tell by looking.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.740
And I can tell that you're 
drunk off your ass!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.910
Shut up. I'm celebrating!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:49.540
--Then give me some!
--Calm down, you two!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.500
Well, it's good to know they never change.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.210
It makes me feel like I can count on them.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:59.170
Hey, is this Ryuzoji guy really coming?

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.390
Yeah, probably.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:05.310
But I won't let him stop this.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:23.740
My people, we shall now perform the ritual.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:28.580
The bizarre weather events,
the famines they caused,

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:33.330
and the attacks by the strange monsters,

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.050
it's time for all of them to end.

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:41.260
My people, you have done well
to endure this time of suffering.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:46.970
Here and now, the ritual to bring peace
to Dela Granto will be held!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.400
So that's...

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.310
Mother?

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:08.260
O great Grantia, let your
mind enter into our priestess!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.740
Grantia-<i>sama</i>?

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.030
Indeed.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:30.580
I will now disable the
bodily functions of the priestess.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.910
It will hurt a little.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:33.910
All right.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.750
Come this way, then.

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:41.050
Initiating dimensional 
synchronization system.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:45.170
Eighteen hundred seconds
until complete synchronization.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:47.890
It seems it will still take some time...

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.430
Yu-No, you can do this!

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:57.060
The event elements are in flux...

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:04.280
Hey!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.320
What is that?

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:06.570
A bird?

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.990
No way.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.320
That's...

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.120
What is it?

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:16.660
Y-Yu-No!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.290
That sound...

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.040
So he's appeared.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.340
Calm down!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.920
Await orders!

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:31.720
So I failed to even scratch it?

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:34.770
Ryuzoji!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.350
So he's here, huh?

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.390
That was one hell of an entrance!

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:42.770
Why are you interfering with the ritual?

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.490
Why do you desire the
destruction of both worlds?

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:52.530
My life is eternal, and to me,
destruction is an inevitability.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.910
No matter how much men struggle,

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:59.210
the conclusion that awaits them
at the end of eternity is unchangeable.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:05.000
I'm simply making that
conclusion come a little sooner

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:10.800
with dimensional collision,
the ultimate catastrophe.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:14.680
Pitiful creature that lives forever...

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.850
The joy of life comes from
the fact that it has an end!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.770
I'll help you understand that!

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:25.020
Activate the device!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.200
We knew you were coming to stop us.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.080
This barrier is powerful.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:43.330
You will not be able to leave this area.

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:48.380
Even without a body,
the event collision will destroy you.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:53.390
I knew you were a clever girl.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.180
You've taken me myself as a hostage?

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:59.020
The ritual will proceed no matter the price.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.560
I won't let you touch Yu-No.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:06.480
Grantia-<i>sama</i>, what's going on outside?

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:09.150
Priestess, you must focus your mind.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:11.650
Focus on yourself.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:15.530
Fifteen hundred seconds
until complete synchronization.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.910
Nothing will come of further conflict.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.250
If you're willing to stay put
until the ritual's done,

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.370
we promise you fair treatment.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.540
Your words are strong,

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:30.710
but you can't hide the fear in your heart.

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.970
There are 25 minutes left.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:37.930
You don't expect them all
to pass without incident.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.600
And also...

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.350
As the ritual proceeds,

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:45.190
the events of Dela Granto will
become more and more unstable.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:51.070
But we're doing the ritual!

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.700
Stay calm!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:55.160
Women and children first!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.620
My drink is ruined!

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.240
Is this his doing?

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:01.620
Focus!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.250
If you don't...

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:06.540
The air is shaking...

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.260
Is everyone in danger?

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:17.590
You must focus on the
ritual's completion not the people.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.220
But...

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:22.930
Priestess, would you sacrifice
hundreds of millions of creatures

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:26.650
to save a few hundred lives?

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:31.610
You're the only one who can save both worlds.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.900
Yes.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.410
You can't leave this place.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.370
What can you do?

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:48.170
If I can't touch the priestess herself,
I must merely choose another method.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.750
What will you do?

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:52.300
Behold.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.590
It's almost time.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:02.060
A dimensional rift?

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.640
Indeed.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:07.850
Only a few can exist inside that subspace.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:11.480
Now, here they come!

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.120
What are these things?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.080
Creatures without bodies!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.710
Be careful, Amanda!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.380
I know!

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:40.260
Well? Don't you think it's beautiful?

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:43.430
I can't believe you can do
something on this scale...

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.890
You seemed to have
prepared for my intervention,

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:50.560
but you should've prepared better.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.940
That horde has lost its home,

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.900
and I must guide it.

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:01.120
Go, wandering souls!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:05.200
Destroy everything and bring chaos.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:16.550
Damn it!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:17.800
There's too many!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.930
Take this! Take this!

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.220
Leader, what's the plan?

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.890
We have to fight!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.600
But there's so many!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:31.310
Damn it! There's just too many of them!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.820
Twelve hundred seconds
to complete synchronization.

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:37.070
There's still that much time?

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:42.110
Wandering souls... gather!

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.580
They're after the barrier device!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.330
Protect it, everyone!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.330
--Right!
--On it!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:59.800
The event disruption is 
more than anticipated.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:03.510
The energy it comprises is multiple times
what I experienced 400 years ago.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:07.390
At this rate,
the dimensional walls will collapse.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:11.810
What's going on?

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.440
Holes are opening in space!

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.150
Be careful, Amanda!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.570
Takuya!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:40.920
Let me go!

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.680
Or I'll take you with me!

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.840
Don't worry! I'll save you!

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.850
Takuya, let go.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.680
Let go.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:54.270
Don't give up!

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:58.230
My sister will be mad
that I couldn't visit her grave.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.230
No! Stop!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:04.950
Takuya, I'm glad we met.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.700
Thank you.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.910
For being with me on my last night.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.210
Amanda...

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:21.880
Amanda!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.470
Leader...

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.600
Amanda-<i>san</i>...

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:33.600
So she disappeared beyond
the dimensional horizon?

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:39.320
Or perhaps she was sent
to a different world, like us.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:47.990
Nine hundred seconds
to complete synchronization.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.540
Fifteen minutes left...

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:58.960
Now, how many will die?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:41.530
"Episode 26: A Girl Who Chants
Love at the Bound of This World"

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:41.190
Episode 26: "A Girl Who Chants
Love at the Bound of This World."
